# Playwright Best Practices

- Use `@playwright/test` — no mixed test runners
- Prefer `getByRole`, `getByLabel`, `getByTestId` over brittle CSS/XPath
- Use `baseURL` from config; navigate with relative paths where possible
- Enable `trace: on-first-retry`, screenshots and video on failure
- Avoid `page.waitForTimeout()` — use `expect` auto-waiting or `waitFor` with conditions
- Keep specs thin; move selectors and actions to page objects
- Use `test.describe` grouped by feature; tag with `@smoke` / `@regression`
- Run smoke before regression in CI/local workflow

```javascript
// Prefer
await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Login' }).click();

// Avoid
await page.locator('#btn-login-xyz').click();
```
